# Packages published at https://npm.skymob.app: only the versions named here are
# served. The Public release button in SkyMobDev/packages adds them, so an
# internal release to GitHub Packages reaches library authors only when someone
# presses it.
#
# Edit it with record-version.mjs, not by hand: the matching hash in SHA256SUMS
# moves with it, and the publish workflow refuses a commit where the two
# disagree. Taking a version off is `node record-version.mjs --remove <name>
# <version>` in a pull request.
#
# Format: "<package> <version> <promoted-at>", one per line. <promoted-at> is
# the UTC time the version was listed; the index gives it to clients as the
# version's publish time, which pnpm's minimumReleaseAge counts from.
#
# A version range resolves among the versions listed here. A lock file names
# its version's tarball on the pool release directly, so it keeps installing
# while that file stays on the release.

